Took Rast's advice and went and did the quest.  Prayed some, sac'ed
some, got crowned (yaaa finger of death!), tamed a horse and poly'ed it
into an ice troll.  (Hey, he's better than he was as a horse.)  I was
hoping to dig below Medusa, but I ended up back in the Room of Angries.
 They were even angrier, and after the black dragon showed up and
disintegrated my cloak and leather armor I dug down again.  Blessed a
